---
import PageLayout from "../../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Card from "../../components/Card.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="What We Do"
  intro="Community-rooted solutions across development, mobility, and leadership."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 space-y-16">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-gray-500 uppercase">
          What We Do at Vision 8:28
        </p>

        <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold leading-tight">
          From Strategy to Execution—We Build Economies That Perform And Uplift The Economic Viability Of Communities
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We design, deploy, and manage economic development initiatives that produce measurable growth
          across people, communities, and industries.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6">
          <a
            href="#focus-areas"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#24a4b9] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-90 transition"
          >
            View Our Focus Areas →
          </a>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-gray-500">
          Hero image suggestions: education & trade skills, workforce training environments,
          entrepreneurs collaborating, infrastructure/logistics, data visualization overlays.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <Card padding="sm">
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] rounded-md bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-gray-500">
            Hero image placeholder
          </div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
            Replace with workforce, entrepreneurship, or infrastructure montage.
          </p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Problems We Solve -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
        Problems We Solve Daily
      </h2>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <Card padding="md">
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Too many economic development efforts operate in silos and offer generic programming for the sake
            of programming—workforce disconnected from employers, entrepreneurs disconnected from capital,
            and funding disconnected from outcomes.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We integrate the entire system across an IEDC (Infrastructure Edge Data Center) Model that connects
            all stakeholders in order to deliver substantive, measurable value.
          </p>
        </Card>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Focus Areas -->
    <section id="focus-areas">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
        Our Core Focus Areas
      </h2>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Growth Intelligence &amp; Strategy</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3">
            Data-informed decisions that reduce risk and improve ROI.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">
            Workforce &amp; Talent Development (UpSkilling &amp; ReSkilling)
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3">
            Job-ready pipelines aligned to real employer demand, plus apprenticeships,
            certification programs, and OJT (On-The-Job Training) pathways.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">
            Entrepreneurship &amp; Small Business Enablement
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3">
            Scalable support for startups and minority-owned businesses.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">
            Place-Based Economic Development
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3">
            Targeted strategies for underserved, rural, and opportunity communities.
          </p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <h3 class="font-semibold">
            Public–Private Partnerships
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3">
            Faster execution through aligned stakeholders.
          </p>
        </Card>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Proof of Impact -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">
        Proof of Impact (Metrics Placeholder)
      </h2>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">

        <Card padding="md">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Programs launched</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">—</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Across multiple regions</p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Partnerships activated</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">—</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Multi-sector collaborations</p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Funding leveraged</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">—</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Federal &amp; philanthropic</p>
        </Card>

        <Card padding="md">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Pipelines established</p>
          <p class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">—</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2">Workforce &amp; entrepreneurship</p>
        </Card>

      </div>

      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500 italic">
        Metrics will populate as initiatives scale.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section>
      <Card padding="lg">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-6">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">
              See Our Programs in Action
            </h2>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2 max-w-2xl">
              Explore active and completed initiatives delivering measurable outcomes
              across communities and industries.
            </p>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/projects"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[#24a4b9] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:opacity-90 transition"
          >
            View Projects →
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </section>

  </section>
</PageLayout>